# Purpose/owner: select the entire damengbackup native custody input document.
# Type/units: canonical absolute protected JSON file path, no units.
# Required/default/range: exactly one when this env-file is supplied; no default;
# readable operator-owned 0600 single-link regular file, format_version=1.
# Secrets: only references to the existing connector/schema files; never inline
# passwords, connection strings, keys or native license bytes in this env-file.
# Precedence/mapping: LoadNativeContext(baseFile, environmentFile) validates base,
# then this sole key replaces the entire typed input. It is separate from the
# recovery tool-configuration env-file; unknown/duplicate/empty keys fail closed.
# Reload/restart: next explicit operator invocation only, no live reload.
# Integration: pass explicitly via the existing central CLI/config owner after
# wiring; this example does not claim the central command already exists.
PROJECT_ONE_DAMENG_RECOVERY_NATIVE_CONTEXT_FILE=/opt/projectone/private/dameng-native-context.json
